      <video:title>Mari El Radio 2.6: a big update to the Android app</video:title>
      <video:description>The radio keeps playing even when mobile internet is limited to whitelisted services: the app switches to a backup stream via Yandex Radio on its own. Plus a new main screen, auto-reconnect, a sleep timer that works in the background and a smoother Android Auto.</video:description>
